{"id":"G1032","name":"INC Ransom","aliases":["GOLD IONIC"],"url":"https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1032","summary":"INC Ransom is a ransomware and data extortion threat group associated with the deployment of INC Ransomware that has been active since at least July 2023. INC Ransom has targeted organizations worldwide most commonly in the industrial, healthcare, and education sectors in the US and Europe.","summaryCites":[{"name":"Bleeping Computer INC Ransomware March 2024","url":"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/inc-ransom-threatens-to-leak-3tb-of-nhs-scotland-stolen-data/"},{"name":"Cybereason INC Ransomware November 2023","url":"https://www.cybereason.com/hubfs/dam/collateral/reports/threat-alert-inc-ransomware.pdf"},{"name":"Secureworks GOLD IONIC April 2024","url":"https://www.secureworks.com/blog/gold-ionic-deploys-inc-ransomware"}],"procedures":[{"id":"T1036.005","text":"INC Ransom has named a PsExec executable winupd to mimic a legitimate Windows update file.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"},{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1070.004","text":"INC Ransom has uninstalled tools from compromised endpoints after use.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransomware May 2024","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/lolbin-to-inc-ransomware"}]},{"id":"T1078","text":"INC Ransom has used compromised valid accounts for access to victim environments.","cites":[{"name":"Cybereason INC Ransomware November 2023","url":"https://www.cybereason.com/hubfs/dam/collateral/reports/threat-alert-inc-ransomware.pdf"},{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"},{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1685","text":"INC Ransom can use SystemSettingsAdminFlows.exe, a native Windows utility, to disable Windows Defender.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransomware May 2024","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/lolbin-to-inc-ransomware"}]},{"id":"T1588.002","text":"INC Ransom has acquired and used several tools including MegaSync, AnyDesk, esentutl and PsExec.","cites":[{"name":"Cybereason INC Ransomware November 2023","url":"https://www.cybereason.com/hubfs/dam/collateral/reports/threat-alert-inc-ransomware.pdf"},{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"},{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1190","text":"INC Ransom has exploited known vulnerabilities including CVE-2023-3519 in Citrix NetScaler for initial access.","cites":[{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"},{"name":"SentinelOne INC Ransomware","url":"https://www.sentinelone.com/anthology/inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1566","text":"INC Ransom has used phishing to gain initial access.","cites":[{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"},{"name":"SentinelOne INC Ransomware","url":"https://www.sentinelone.com/anthology/inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1047","text":"INC Ransom has used WMIC to deploy ransomware.","cites":[{"name":"Cybereason INC Ransomware November 2023","url":"https://www.cybereason.com/hubfs/dam/collateral/reports/threat-alert-inc-ransomware.pdf"},{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"},{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1059.003","text":"INC Ransom has used `cmd.exe` to launch malicious payloads.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"}]},{"id":"T1569.002","text":"INC Ransom has run a file encryption executable via `Service Control Manager/7045;winupd,%SystemRoot%\\winupd.exe,user mode service,demand start,LocalSystem`.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"}]},{"id":"T1046","text":"INC Ransom has used NETSCAN.EXE for internal reconnaissance.","cites":[{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"},{"name":"SentinelOne INC Ransomware","url":"https://www.sentinelone.com/anthology/inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1049","text":"INC Ransom has used RDP to test network connections.","cites":[{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1069.002","text":"INC Ransom has enumerated domain groups on targeted hosts.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"}]},{"id":"T1087.002","text":"INC Ransom has scanned for domain admin accounts in compromised environments.","cites":[{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1135","text":"INC Ransom has used Internet Explorer to view folders on other systems.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"}]},{"id":"T1021.001","text":"INC Ransom has used RDP to move laterally.","cites":[{"name":"Cybereason INC Ransomware November 2023","url":"https://www.cybereason.com/hubfs/dam/collateral/reports/threat-alert-inc-ransomware.pdf"},{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"},{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1570","text":"INC Ransom has used a rapid succession of copy commands to install a file encryption executable across multiple endpoints within compromised infrastructure.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"},{"name":"Secureworks GOLD IONIC April 2024","url":"https://www.secureworks.com/blog/gold-ionic-deploys-inc-ransomware"}]},{"id":"T1074","text":"INC Ransom has staged data on compromised hosts prior to exfiltration.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"},{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1560.001","text":"INC Ransom has used 7-Zip and WinRAR to archive collected data prior to exfiltration.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"},{"name":"Secureworks GOLD IONIC April 2024","url":"https://www.secureworks.com/blog/gold-ionic-deploys-inc-ransomware"},{"name":"SOCRadar INC Ransom January 2024","url":"https://socradar.io/dark-web-profile-inc-ransom/"}]},{"id":"T1071","text":"INC Ransom has used valid accounts over RDP to connect to targeted systems.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"}]},{"id":"T1105","text":"INC Ransom has downloaded tools to compromised servers including Advanced IP Scanner.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/investigating-new-inc-ransom-group-activity"},{"name":"Huntress INC Ransomware May 2024","url":"https://www.huntress.com/blog/lolbin-to-inc-ransomware"}]},{"id":"T1219","text":"INC Ransom has used AnyDesk and PuTTY on compromised systems.","cites":[{"name":"Huntress INC Ransom Group August 2023","url":"https://www.huntress.c